# D2: divider hover. An in-app pointer moves over the tiles and every
# tracking area's owner gets the entered/exited/moved events AppKit would
# send (DividerHoverAutomation): no OS input, the real pointer untouched.
# The hovered divider, its hint line and the app's cursor follow the
# pointer, whichever order a step's events arrive in.
log D2 divider hover
delivery direct
until terminal.phase attached 10000
expect kind manual
# --- manual: a | (b / c): a T where b's gutter meets the root's ---
core {"method":"layout.split","params":{"direction":"right"}}
until tiles 2 3000
core {"method":"layout.split","params":{"direction":"down"}}
until tiles 3 3000
wait 2500
expect dividers 2
divider list
# libghostty's shape for every terminal: text.
divider hover shape text
divider hover jump tile 1
expect hover none
expect cursor ibeam
expect hint none

# Slowly (a point a step) onto the vertical divider, then over to the
# horizontal one: the report's case.
divider hover to gutter - 0.25
expect hover -
expect cursor resize-lr
expect hint -
divider hover to gutter b 0.5
expect hover b
expect cursor resize-ud
expect hint b
# Off it into a terminal: libghostty's shape comes back.
divider hover to tile 2
expect hover none
expect cursor ibeam
expect hint none
# And straight from a terminal onto a gutter, then the other way.
divider hover to gutter b 0.5
expect hover b
expect cursor resize-ud
divider hover to gutter - 0.8
expect hover -
expect cursor resize-lr
expect hint -
divider hover to tile 3
expect hover none
expect cursor ibeam
expect hint none

# The T: down the root's gutter past where b's meets it (it stays the
# root's), then a few points right onto b's, and back.
divider hover to gutter - 0.25
divider hover to gutter - 0.75
expect hover -
expect cursor resize-lr
divider hover to gutter b 0
divider hover to off 4 0
expect hover b
expect cursor resize-ud
expect hint b
divider hover to off -8 0
expect hover -
expect cursor resize-lr
expect hint -

# Fast flicks: one event each.
divider hover jump tile 1
expect hover none
expect cursor ibeam
divider hover jump gutter b 0.5
expect hover b
expect cursor resize-ud
divider hover jump gutter - 0.5
expect hover -
expect cursor resize-lr
divider hover jump tile 2
expect hover none
expect cursor ibeam

# libghostty changing its shape doesn't take the cursor off a divider, and
# its latest shape is the one that comes back.
divider hover shape pointer
expect cursor pointer
divider hover to gutter b 0.5
expect cursor resize-ud
divider hover shape text
expect cursor resize-ud
divider hover shape pointer
expect cursor resize-ud
divider hover to tile 3
expect cursor pointer
divider hover shape text
expect cursor ibeam

# The same walks with each step's events in other orders.
divider hover order enter-first
divider hover to gutter - 0.3
expect hover -
divider hover to gutter b 0.5
expect hover b
expect cursor resize-ud
expect hint b
divider hover to gutter b 0
divider hover to off -4 0
expect hover -
expect cursor resize-lr
divider hover to tile 2
expect hover none
expect cursor ibeam
expect hint none
divider hover order moved-first
divider hover to gutter - 0.3
expect hover -
divider hover to gutter b 0.5
expect hover b
expect cursor resize-ud
expect hint b
divider hover to tile 3
expect hover none
expect cursor ibeam
expect hint none
divider hover order exit-first

# A drag: released on the divider, it's still hovered where it now is;
# its pointer area moved with it, so leaving it lets go.
divider drag b 0.30 250
expect divider.b 0.30
expect hover b
expect hint b
expect cursor resize-ud
# (the mirror's echo may move the tiles a moment; nothing hovers mid-motion)
wait 900
# (libghostty may pick a new shape on a resize or a key with mouse
# reporting on: set it again, the cursor goes by whatever it says)
divider hover shape text
divider hover to tile 3
expect hover none
expect cursor ibeam
expect hint none
divider hover to gutter b 0.5
expect hover b
expect hint b

# --- a cross: (a / d) | (b / c), both stacked gutters meet the root's ---
divider hover out
divider double b
wait 700
expect divider.b 0.50
key alt+h
wait 300
core {"method":"layout.split","params":{"direction":"down"}}
until tiles 4 3000
wait 1500
divider list
divider hover shape text
divider hover jump tile 1
expect hover none
expect cursor ibeam
divider hover to gutter a 0.5
expect hover a
expect cursor resize-ud
expect hint a
divider hover to gutter - 0.5
expect hover -
expect cursor resize-lr
expect hint -
divider hover to gutter b 0.5
expect hover b
expect cursor resize-ud
expect hint b
divider hover to gutter b 0
divider hover to off -12 0
expect hover a
expect cursor resize-ud
divider hover to tile 1
expect hover none
expect cursor ibeam
expect hint none
divider hover out
expect hover none
